# Logs and runtime state
*.log
logs/
*.jsonl
game/server/live-npc-lab/data/*.jsonl

# Story/twist spoiler content — OneDrive only, never repo, even private
game/server/live-npc-lab/data/lore-snippets.json

# npc-profiles.json is NOT ignored, deliberately. It is a test input:
# test/npc-profiles.mjs reads data/npc-profiles.json directly and CI fails with
# ENOENT without it. It also holds no spoiler material — the file self-declares
# noClassifiedPlotMaterial, and every id in it (sup-guide, camp-guard,
# c0d3x-rider, ...) is already committed inside test/npc-profiles.mjs, which
# hard-asserts them. Ignoring it protected nothing and broke the build.
# lore-snippets.json stays ignored: test/lore-retrieval.mjs writes its own
# temp fixture and never reads the real file.

# Backups, exports, and cold copies
ops/backups/
**/backups/
**/*coldcopy*/
**/*export*/

# OS/editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

